        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Endakaano ya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ne Baisiraeli mu sibala sia Moabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko kamakhuwa ke ndakaano niyo Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aalaka Musa akhole ne babaandu ba Isiraeli mu sibala sia Moabu. Endakaano yino yaba khutasa khu niyo aakhola nabo a sikulu sia Sinai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa aalaanga alala babaandu ba Isiraeli boosi mala aababoolela ali, “Mwabeene mwabona koosi niko Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aakhola khu Farao, omwami owe Misiri, ne bakholi bewe ne khu sibala sioosi ebweeni wenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwabona kamakhako, kamaya, nende bie khuukia biboofu nibio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aakhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khukhwola khu ndaalo yino Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi akhamuelesia enywe limanya, libona namwe liiulila tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khu miiko kamakhumi kane ese namwimeelela mwabira mu sichiimi, ne kakhali chingubo chenywe se chatabuukhe tawe, namwe biraaro bienywe se biatabuukhe tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Se mwalia siakhulia namwe mwanywa endali namwe kamalwa tawe. Kaba kario nio enywe mumanye muli Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, ali Wele wenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.21+NUM.21.22+NUM.21.23+NUM.21.24+NUM.21.25+NUM.21.26+NUM.21.27+NUM.21.28+NUM.21.29+NUM.21.30+NUM.21.31+NUM.21.32+NUM.21.33+NUM.21.34+NUM.21.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khub. 21.21-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali efwe nga khwola abuundu ano, omwami Sihoni owa Heshiboni ne omwami Oku owa Bashani barura bakhwibwaakala efwe, mala efwe khwabaula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.32.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khub. 32.33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Khwabukula sibala siabwe, mala khwasikaba chikholo cha Rubeni, Kati nende balala khu kholo eya Manase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako ba barekerefu khukhola koosi kaali mu ndakaano yino nio muindiaale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Endaalo yino enywe mweesi mwemile ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe. Babemeelesi benywe ne basaakhulu ne banamae bakhulu babaandu be siseecha boosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aakhaba bakhasi, nende babaana ne baakwa bamenyile mwinywe, nende bamwasakilanga enywe chiikhu ne khumusutila kameechi bosi bali ano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mweesi muli ano endaalo yino, khukhola endakaano ne Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wefwe, niyo alikho akhola ne nanywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi eenya amukhole enywe luno khuuba babaandu bewe, alaba Wele wenywe, nga ne aamusuubisia enywe nende bakuuka benywe, Aburahamu, Isaaka ne Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi se alikho akhola endakaano eye liliechuba yino ne nanywe mweng'ene tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alikho akhola ne nafwe fweesi khukhwimile ano ebweeni wewe, endaalo yino akhaba nende be lisaaye liefwe bakhasaalwa tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Enywe mumanyile nga ne khwamenya mu Misiri, lundi nga ne khwabira mu sibala sie chikholo chichiindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwabona bifwaani biabwe bie khusinya bibiakholwa khukhwama khu mirongooro, kamabaale, efwesa nende esahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.12.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Baeb. 12.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba burekeerefu nio akhabao omundu owe siseecha namwe owe siikhasi, be munju yosi yosi namwe ekholo eyimile ano endaalo yino olekelesia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wefwe mala ache akholele bawele be chikholo chichiindi tawe. Kano kaliba nga lusia lwe kumurongooro kukhula kube simelwa silulu lundi sie bufwisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu akhabao endaalo yino olikho oulila kamakhuwa ke endakaano eye liliechuba yino mala ebiite omwene chikhabi ne aloma ali, ‘Ndaba busa bulayi nakhakhola sileka.’ Lilienelio lilamubunia enywe mweesi, balayi ne baabi sitube. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi se alabeela omundu nga oyo ario tawe. Ne kakhali lirima lia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ne likhendekha bilamuburukhirakho, mala bilaamo bioosi bibiaandikwa mu sitabu sino bilamwichakho nabwila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi alamubunisila enywe elala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi alamukhola niye abe silolelo ebweeni we chikholo choosi cha Isiraeli. Kakhekholekhe kario khuloondekhana ne bilaamo bioosi bie endakaano bibiaandikwa mu sitabu sie kamalaka sino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mu selukho eyiicha, lisaaye lienywe enyuma wenywe ne baakwa khukhwama mu bibala bie aleeyi balibona butinyu ne bulwaale nibwo Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi areerire mu sibala sienywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.24+GEN.19.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lir. 19.24-25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kimikuunda kiliba bitalalie bikhasaala bibiaamo tawe, kikhafuunikhwe ne kumulilo nende chumbe se siliio silibiaalwa tawe. Aakhaba enyoonyi se limelamo tawe. Sibala sienywe sikhabe busa nga chingoba cha Sodomu ne Komora nende Atima ne Seboimu nicho Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi abunia nga ne aba ne akhalala lukali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chikholo choosi chilireeba chili, ‘Siina sikila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ne akhola kano khu sibala sino? Sifuno sie lirima liewe lirafu sili siina?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne babaandu bakhakobosie bali, ‘Sikila balekelesia endakaano niyo Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owe bakuuka babwe aakhola ne nabo nga ne aabarusia mu Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
