              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bibiindu bikhamanyikhaane bili bia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wefwe ne kakhali nibio niye aakhwekesia bili bibiefwe ne lisaaye liefwe khulwa mindali na mindali. Khukhoya khurie kamalaka kano koosi.",
          "type": "text",
